OL,3,GNEWSAChildcare staff shortages persist,
OL,4,Asurvey suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA smaller workforce and recruitment
OL,7,Fdifficulties are key issues faced by
OL,8,FJersey's childcare sector, a survey has
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FThe Childcare and Early Years Service
OL,12,Fcommissioned an independent survey of
OL,13,Fproviders in the island to gather
OL,14,Finformation on the capacity of the
OL,15,Fsector.
OL,17,FThe survey suggested, excluding
OL,18,Fgovernment nurseries, the workforce
OL,19,Ffell by 13% in 2025 and more staff were
OL,20,Fworking part time - rising from 15% in
OL,21,F2024 to 27% last year.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
