OL,3,GNEWSAChildcare staff shortages persist,
OL,4,Asurvey suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt indicated the number of childcare
OL,7,Fproviders had fallen from 134 in 2023
OL,8,Fto 126 in 2025.
